WEBVTT

00:00.330 --> 00:02.300
<b>Here's a picture of Gamers.</b>

00:02.400 --> 00:05.420
<b>Doesn't it look
just like the scene from before?</b>

00:05.530 --> 00:07.930
<b>Which Gamers was it?
The Akihabara store?</b>

00:08.040 --> 00:11.370
<b>I think it's Akihabara,
but I don't remember.</b>

00:11.470 --> 00:13.740
<b>Do you, Koge-Donbo?</b>

00:13.840 --> 00:16.070
<b>I don't know.
Probably Akihabara.</b>

00:17.350 --> 00:19.640
<b>They did go there for research.</b>

00:22.020 --> 00:23.880
<b>The first floor
of the Akihabara store?</b>

00:23.990 --> 00:29.080
<b>At the time,
Broccoli had two stores in Akihabara.</b>

00:29.190 --> 00:31.420
<b>Maybe three.</b>

00:33.860 --> 00:37.130
<b>It's before the Dejiko building
was open in Akihabara.</b>

00:37.230 --> 00:39.670
<b>Yes, it's before then.</b>

00:41.170 --> 00:44.370
<b>Then maybe
we only had one store</b>

00:45.370 --> 00:48.240
<b>called the ''Square Shop.''</b>

00:49.480 --> 00:52.710
<b>Wow, this is normal.</b>

00:59.550 --> 01:03.420
<b>This character made
a rather normal appearance.</b>

01:03.530 --> 01:06.190
<b>He gets weirder later on.</b>

01:06.490 --> 01:09.430
<b>But he's wearing a sunflower
on his chest.</b>

01:09.530 --> 01:10.660
<b>Is he stylish too?</b>

01:10.770 --> 01:13.230
<b>Why did he wear one?</b>

01:14.370 --> 01:18.170
<b>The director wanted him to
change flowers depending on his mood.</b>

01:18.270 --> 01:20.570
<b>I told him to do as he pleased,</b>

01:20.680 --> 01:23.640
<b>and the flowers kept changing
all the time.</b>

01:40.860 --> 01:44.630
<b>When we created this character,</b>

01:44.730 --> 01:48.570
<b>we were targeting female fans.</b>

01:48.670 --> 01:55.910
<b>Note: bi-seinen - beautiful young man</b>

01:48.670 --> 01:50.170
<b>A bi-seinen?</b>

01:50.170 --> 01:55.910
<b>Yes. With Minataku, it would be
a bi-seinen and a bishounen combo,</b>

01:56.010 --> 02:01.170
<b>Note: bishounen - beautiful young boy</b>

01:56.010 --> 01:59.680
<b>and we thought
the girls would like them.</b>

01:59.680 --> 02:01.170
<b>But it didn't work.</b>

02:01.280 --> 02:03.250
<b>He wasn't popular to the girls?</b>

02:03.350 --> 02:04.820
<b>Well, you see his personality.</b>

02:04.920 --> 02:06.480
<b>You can't blame them.</b>

02:06.890 --> 02:08.360
<b>Oh, the flowers do change.</b>

02:09.160 --> 02:11.520
<b>This is probably
the third time already.</b>

02:11.630 --> 02:13.420
<b>A Chinese Bellflower?</b>

02:38.050 --> 02:40.420
<b>He's a pathetic character,
isn't he?</b>

02:55.170 --> 02:57.830
<b>When Dejiko was created,</b>

02:57.940 --> 03:01.100
<b>not just the anime,
but the four-panel manga,</b>

03:01.210 --> 03:06.200
<b>did customers at Gamers actually say,
''I'm gonna shop nyo?''</b>

03:07.750 --> 03:11.810
<b>I believe so.</b>

03:14.720 --> 03:20.320
<b>In a good and a bad way,
the word was popular.</b>

03:31.010 --> 03:35.600
<b>This is when Puchiko's character
actually becomes more prominent.</b>

03:43.450 --> 03:45.950
<b>After seeing this scene,</b>
